        "text": "Physical symptoms like falling should be taken seriously even if their cause is unclear.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Misjudging someone based on appearance—especially regarding substance use—is morally wrong.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Delayed diagnosis leads to significant personal and familial hardship.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
