  {
    "episode_id": 90466,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90466.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 65,
    "turn_text": "So this is important for a number of reasons. People often say, what do I do right now if I want to run for office? And I think the question should be, what have you done that's made an impact and impression on you that makes you want to run for office? And what I",
