        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "I personally prefer taking action over passive complaining.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "I care deeply about my neighborhood, community, state, and country.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "It is possible to improve society by working hard and uniting people.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Making meaningful change requires effort and collaboration.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The process of creating change is difficult but worthwhile.",
