      },
      {
        "text": "Political compromise is both feasible and morally preferable to ideological rigidity.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "National progress depends on cooperation across political divides.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Failure to adapt to the global economy threatens national competitiveness.",
