    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90466.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 213,
    "turn_text": "Another issue that apparently is going to come up or that the administration suggests they want to come up in Senator McConnell and Speaker Ryan is tax reform. Not exactly clear whether it's going to be reform or simply tax cuts. But what's your sense of the likelihood of tax reform actually happening and will it be reform?",
