    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 90466,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90466.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 215,
    "turn_text": "There really hasn't been a genuine tax reform in this country for 30 years. And the last time it was done, it was done by, in the classic way, broadening the base and eliminating loopholes. Right. Is that given the army, the failings of lobbyists that patrol your precincts over there, is that possible today?",
