    "turn_text": "Let me just finish up by asking you about the Senate and the Congress in the era of Trump and how that has impacted relationships there. What kind of sense do you get from your colleagues on the other side of the aisle? about how they're processing all of this. He ran as sort of an opponent of Washington generally. He's not a natural ally of Mitch McConnell or Paul Ryan and many of the people who are in the Congress.",
